## Methodology

Risks were evaluated using:
- Likelihood scoring
- Impact scoring
- Risk prioritization
- Mitigation planning
- Compliance-focused security analysis

Risk scoring was calculated using:

```text
Likelihood × Impact = Risk Score
```

